    "3.0",
    "Presentation file created by Harvard Graphics DOS software, which is used to create presentations; contains a series of charts, or slides, which contain formatting, graphics, and text; used for storing and displaying oral presentations. Windows Harvard Graphics 98 Harvard Graphics Chart XL Corel Presentations 2021. Canvas GFX Canvas X Pro.",
