    "Print Shop Deluxe Design File",
    "2.9",
    "Page design created by Broderbunds Print Shop Deluxe publishing software; contains graphics, text, and page layout information; may be used for saving brochures, calendars, invitations, newsletters, and other prints. NOTE: PDG files are used by older versions of Print Shop Deluxe. Windows Broderbund The Print Shop Deluxe.",
