    "Recogniform Form Designer File",
    "2.8",
    "File created by Recogniform document recognition software; contains the page layout structure, text, and other formatting information; used for scanning and storing digital copies of paper forms. Recogniform software is used for optical character recognition (OCR), bar code recognition (BCR), optical mark recognition (OMR), and other intelligent recognition techniques. Windows Recogniform Form Designer. Game data file used by Emperor: Battle for Dune, a real-time strategy game built with the W3D (Westwood 3D) game engine; contains game data, such as maps; used for storing built-in game data as well as bundling custom map packs. Windows Westwood Studios Emperor: Battle for Dune Dragon UnPACKerFree.",
